### ==========================================================
### TRANSACTIONS — crear, quick-add, idempotencia, filtros, update, delete
### Crea sus propias cuentas/categoría arriba para ser autosuficiente.
### ==========================================================
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@email = tester@test.com
@password = SecureP@ss123
@date = 2026-08-31T12:00:00.000Z

# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{email}}", "password": "{{password}}" }

@token = {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### Cuenta A (queda default si es la primera) — para EXPENSE/quick-add
# @name accA
POST {{baseUrl}}/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "TxA", "type": "CASH", "balance": 1000 }

@accA = {{accA.response.body.id}}

### Cuenta B — destino de INCOME/TRANSFER
# @name accB
POST {{baseUrl}}/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "TxB", "type": "SAVINGS", "balance": 500 }

@accB = {{accB.response.body.id}}

### Categoría para clasificar
# @name cat
POST {{baseUrl}}/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "TxCat", "type": "EXPENSE" }

@catId = {{cat.response.body.id}}

### ---------- Éxito ----------

### Crear EXPENSE (resta de A)
# @name expense
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "EXPENSE",
  "amount": 42.50,
  "date": "{{date}}",
  "fromAccountId": "{{accA}}",
  "categoryId": "{{catId}}",
  "tags": ["café", "hormiga"],
  "note": "prueba"
}

@txId = {{expense.response.body.id}}

### Crear INCOME (suma a B)
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "type": "INCOME", "amount": 300, "date": "{{date}}", "toAccountId": "{{accB}}" }

### Crear TRANSFER (A -> B)
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "type": "TRANSFER", "amount": 100, "date": "{{date}}", "fromAccountId": "{{accA}}", "toAccountId": "{{accB}}" }

### Idempotencia — mismo Idempotency-Key dos veces = una sola transacción
### Corre esta y la siguiente: deben devolver el MISMO id.
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: demo-key-001
Content-Type: application/json

{ "type": "EXPENSE", "amount": 9.99, "date": "{{date}}", "fromAccountId": "{{accA}}" }

### Idempotencia — reintento con la misma clave (devuelve la existente)
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: demo-key-001
Content-Type: application/json

{ "type": "EXPENSE", "amount": 9.99, "date": "{{date}}", "fromAccountId": "{{accA}}" }

### Quick-add — solo amount (usa la cuenta default, marca pendingDetails)
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions/quick
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": 5.25 }

### Bandeja de pendientes de detallar
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions?pendingDetails=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Listar (todas, orden por fecha desc)
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Filtrar por cuenta
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions?accountId={{accA}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Filtrar por tipo
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions?type=EXPENSE
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get por id
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions/{{txId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Update — cambia monto (revierte y reaplica balance)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/transactions/{{txId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": 60, "note": "editada" }

### Delete (soft) — revierte el efecto en el balance
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/transactions/{{txId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ---------- Casos de error ----------

### EXPENSE con toAccountId (no permitido) (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "type": "EXPENSE", "amount": 10, "date": "{{date}}", "fromAccountId": "{{accA}}", "toAccountId": "{{accB}}" }

### INCOME sin toAccountId (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "type": "INCOME", "amount": 10, "date": "{{date}}" }

### TRANSFER misma cuenta (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "type": "TRANSFER", "amount": 10, "date": "{{date}}", "fromAccountId": "{{accA}}", "toAccountId": "{{accA}}" }

### Monto 0 (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "type": "EXPENSE", "amount": 0, "date": "{{date}}", "fromAccountId": "{{accA}}" }

### Monto con 3 decimales (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "type": "EXPENSE", "amount": 10.555, "date": "{{date}}", "fromAccountId": "{{accA}}" }

### fromAccountId de otro usuario / inexistente (404)
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "type": "EXPENSE", "amount": 10, "date": "{{date}}", "fromAccountId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000" }
